  characterProfile: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 818ad623f9b186b578de99d894093c17, type: 2}
  characterName: Sophia
  characterPortrait: {fileID: 2568956360853038877, guid: ef7dcaf3f511c1944af9ea28835b166c, type: 3}
  sentences:
  - Did you know that the parasite that is in The First of You actually exists?
  - It is called Ophiocordyceps unilateralis, but you can also call it by its cooler
    name
  - Zombie-ant fungus
  - "It literally takes over the ant\u2019s body"
  - I mean, it eats the ant from the inside out, but also controls it
  - "Eventually it kills it and the fungi grows out of the ant\u2019s head"
  - The coolest part is that
  - If the human body was colder
  - That could actually happen to us
  - And we would all become zombies
  - "Wouldn\u2019t that be cool?"
  textSpeed: 0.01
  endAutomatically: 1
